invariant: INV-7
file: suite.h
catches: webpki_loop_aes_extern
reason: an AES=extern build takes the AES-first default order that only a
  host object whose caller sets CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_AES may take
  (docs/decisions.md 80 and 89). Under AES=extern GHASH runs on gcm.c's
  portable multiply and nothing measures the peripheral, so both ends must
  keep ChaCha20 first.

--- old
#if defined(CH_SUITE_AES_GCM) && defined(CH_CPU_RUNTIME)
--- new
#if defined(CH_SUITE_AES_GCM)
